"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-11-29T00:48:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:38:28Z","closed_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99816","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99816.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z"},"body":"Summarizing my notes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2505762287:\r\n\r\n1) At the time of the loop in `copy_from`, `strlen()` has already established that no `NULL` is contained in the string range. We can make use of this assumption by simply deleting the check for it.\r\n2) This is also true for `copy_from_unchecked`, where this assumption has already been documented above the function. It is a module-local function that's otherwise only used on substrings, where the contract of no-null is equally true (if dubious).\r\n3) Casting rules of the C++ spec ensure us that a cast from `char` to `uint8_t` will always reinterpret the bits in the same way that the manual check did in the current code ([example](https://onlinegdb.com/EGWnFbsxF)). Clang is able to optimize this manual conversion away, but [MSVC cannot](https://godbolt.org/z/PY8xW9EWa). It is therefor optimizable.\r\n4) Running pointers reduce the amount of unnecessary addition operations. \r\n\r\nEverything put together, the `copy_from` loop is very likely to be SMID vectorized by the compiler now, improving its throughput by up to an estimated 8x.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99816/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99816/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}